-- @record {"chapter":"proofs-b-local-harness","data":"Windows receipt reads retry only actual access/sharing errors5/32/33 or CRT EACCES without a Win32 code for at most twenty attempts, fifty milliseconds apart; malformed JSON and persistent denial remain rejected. Startup holds a real exclusive native file handle, proves delayed release restores the original receipt, and proves persistent denial fails closed. A failed concurrent launch verifies and stops any owned child before releasing its execution gate.","key":"11","section":"guidance"}
